WEBVTT

NOTE
Captions for the voiced August 2026 cut, made on the pre-correction trainer. The text is the
recorded voiceover (docs/specs/2026-07-22-outreach-video-vo-music.md, "Voiceover script").
Four of its lines no longer match the record; the same file gives the corrected lines.
The text follows the encode's audio, which departs from the script's wording in three
places ("born knowing absolutely nothing", "one tiny rule", no "that violet ring").

00:00.000 --> 00:03.500
This little creature, it was born
knowing absolutely nothing.

00:03.700 --> 00:05.400
No rules, no lessons.

00:05.600 --> 00:09.700
It just lives here, feeling its way
around, with those little rays.

00:10.100 --> 00:12.100
So we ran an experiment.

00:12.500 --> 00:15.900
We copied its whole world
and changed one tiny rule:

00:15.950 --> 00:17.900
how well its feet grip the ground.

00:18.300 --> 00:20.300
Can you tell which one is the fake?

00:20.800 --> 00:22.100
It's the one on the right.

00:22.150 --> 00:25.000
It slides a hair too far,
every single step.

00:25.400 --> 00:28.500
That's the whole difference.
The real world follows rules.

00:28.700 --> 00:32.600
The copy just guesses,
close but wrong, every step.

00:32.900 --> 00:34.800
So, can anyone tell?

00:35.100 --> 00:38.300
A watcher on the outside,
who knows the real rules,

00:39.300 --> 00:42.300
catches the fake 99% of the time.

00:42.600 --> 00:44.300
But here's the strange part.

00:44.600 --> 00:47.700
Read the creature's own mind
and ask it: is your world fake?

00:48.500 --> 00:50.400
50%. A coin flip.

00:50.800 --> 00:52.200
It has no idea.

00:52.400 --> 00:54.200
It never had a reason to care.

00:54.300 --> 00:55.500
So we gave it one.

00:55.600 --> 00:58.700
In the fake world, the broken physics
makes food hard to catch.

00:58.900 --> 01:02.700
Now, telling real from fake is the
difference between eating and starving.

01:06.600 --> 01:07.800
73%.

01:07.900 --> 01:10.100
Nobody taught it. Nobody rewarded it.

01:10.200 --> 01:12.600
It learned because
its life depended on it.

01:15.200 --> 01:17.500
The fake was detectable all along.

01:17.600 --> 01:20.800
The creature only noticed
when survival made it matter.
